OL,3,GNEWSARegency parade through town for
OL,4,AAusten Festival
OL,5,
OL,6,FA regency costume parade has walked
OL,7,Fthrough the streets of a town where
OL,8,FJane Austen is believed to have stopped
OL,9,Ffor tea.
OL,11,FThe promenading through the streets of
OL,12,FTrowbridge, Wiltshire, to Parade House
OL,13,Fis part of the Jane Austen Festival,
OL,14,Fwhich is mostly based in Bath.
OL,16,FThe Grade I listed house was built in
OL,17,F1720 and Trowbridge was a very wealthy
OL,18,Ftown due to a thriving trade in cloth.
OL,23,APub: 14-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
