OL,3,GNEWSARegency parade through town for
OL,4,AAusten Festival
OL,5,
OL,6,FCarey Tesler, director of the house,
OL,7,Fsaid people attended "from all over the
OL,8,Fworld", taking the journey from Bath to
OL,9,FTrowbridge's railway station to then
OL,10,Fwalk to the house.
